            "action_name": {
              "value": "Vie For Victory"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The triumph siktempora pushes themself beyond their limits to secure victory over a chosen foe. They choose one target they can see and reach with a single Stride action. They attempt to Demoralize that target, ignoring the typical limitations on distance and with no penalty for not sharing a language with the target. They then Stride and attempt one Athletics attack action (such as Grapple or Disarm) against the target."
            },
